WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.570
Here's how to play the Mario Kart drinking game.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.610
For this game, you'll need 3 things.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.140
A pack of cheap beer...

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.670
2 to 4 players...

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.710
and any generation of Mario Kart.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.280
From the new Wii U version, all the way back to Super Nintendo.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.830
Even though we all know N64 is the best.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.130
The rules of the game are simple.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.420
Crack open the beer to start the race.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.970
The first player to cross the finish line wins, but

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:27.030
you must finish your beer before you finish the race.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:31.620
The only other rule is that your cart must be at a complete stop before you drink your beer.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:34.170
Because not even Mario tolerates drinking and driving. *Slap*

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:36.980
But you know, drinking right after driving, that's cool.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.270
But don't take our word for how awesome it is.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.570
Here's some people trying out the game for the first time.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.120
Wait, so you drink while you're playing?

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.160
So I should just chug it in the beginning? 

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:46.670
No.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:47.940
At least most of it.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:48.710
That's gonna backfire! 

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.490
Women: That's a good strategy....  Man: I really want to see you do that

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.510
We're about to do it, it's about to start though.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:56.610
No see I feel like i'm gonna fall off a lot so I'm just gonna drink when ever I'm getting lifted up.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.630
Oh shit..

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.160
*screaming*

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.460
I'm gonna go we can't all have the same strategy. 

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.730
Ow that hurts.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.770
This game suddenly got way hard.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:05.790
Ohhhh

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.320
150cc is really fast

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.610
*screaming* *shriek* 

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.440
I'm doing like way good right now, way good. 

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:19.050
See this is a hard time to drink because do we do it when you're in last place? Or do you do it when you're in first?

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:23.900
I thought there'd be like more rules to this game like when you drink, but I guess it's really up to you as a player.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.450
I think it's meant to keep the game kinda pure.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.250
How much did you drink Cody?

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.020
I finished the beer.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.040
Oh my god!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:31.800
Awww man

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:32.820
Ah I don't feel good though.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.610
Oh you just passed me.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.920
Now it's just Mario Kart, man... Now it's just Mario Kart

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:40.220
Yeeaaahh buddy.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:42.000
Eat my banana!

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.040
Did you finish your beer?

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.570
Yes I did! Yes I did! 

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.870
I just won!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.910
Wait you cheated? How did you cheat?

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.440
Wait he's still drinking?

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:54.750
Wait that's against the rules. That means you lost.

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:56.540
I just won the race without drinking the beer

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:57.810
Huuuh! 

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.360
I was finished having beer. *laughter*

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.680
Reviews of the game? I mean it's a classic game with twists.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.230
I mean any excuse to play Mario Kart.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:09.290
Yeah I would definitely play again this is pretty great. 

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:11.070
Mario Kart gets you drunk quick! 

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.370
I think we should figure out a way to do battle.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.660
Yeah, I'm all about battle mode.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.450
Yeah battle mode is the best.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:22.550
Maybe each of your balloons is like a shot, and you have like three shots in front of you.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:26.370
Lets set that up right now you know you want to. 

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.940
You LOST! Arh and you're an adult! 

